<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 99.646 bln esc avg 6.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 99.646 bln esc avg 6.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 99.646 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market in a variable rate repurchase tender at an average weighted interest rate of 6.0 percent effective on Thursday.</p>
</text>
